    {
      "id": "p0096-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the ruins is a sleeping ghost named “Napstablook”. As Toby explains it, this name was originally randomly generated and had no actual inherent meaning:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2899848,
          0.2314286,
          0.9138606,
          0.2678571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2899848,
          0.2314286,
          0.9138606,
          0.2678571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "遗迹里有一个正在睡觉的幽灵，名叫 Napstablook。据 Toby 解释，这个名字原本是随机生成的，本身并没有实际含义：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2940691,
          0.2292857,
          0.9107974,
          0.2735714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2940691,
          0.2292857,
          0.9107974,
          0.2735714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0096-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Basically I used the name to come up with the character. So “blook” sounds like a ghost, then “nap” --> it sleeps, with zzz. After the demo, people noticed “napsta” sounded like Napster [a popular file-sharing service in the early 2000s], so I added the Napster joke as well. Then I explained all of this simultaneously to the translator.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.3349121,
          0.2771429,
          0.9138606,
          0.3692857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.3349121,
          0.2771429,
          0.9138606,
          0.3692857
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "基本上，我是根据名字来构思角色的。blook 听起来像个幽灵，而 nap（打盹）就意味着它会睡觉，还会发出 zzz。试玩版出来后，有人发现 napsta 听起来像 Napster［2000 年代初流行的文件分享服务］，所以我又加上了 Napster 的梗。之后，我把这些一股脑儿都解释给了译者。",
        "status": "draft",
