    {
      "id": "p0096-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because Napstablook’s name contains an old Internet reference, the localizers considered giving the character a name with a similar Japanese reference. For this reason, early drafts of the Japanese script called Napstablook “Winnybohre”. “Winny” was a Japanese file-sharing service that was popular in the mid-2000s, and “bohre” is a play on the Japanese word bōrei, a type of ghost.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2848795,
          0.5521429,
          0.9148817,
          0.645
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2848795,
          0.5521429,
          0.9148817,
          0.645
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "由于 Napstablook 的名字包含一个早期互联网的典故，本地化团队考虑过换成一个含有类似日本典故的名字。因此，早期日文稿把 Napstablook 称作 Winnybohre。Winny 是 2000 年代中期在日本流行的文件分享服务，bohre 则是在日语 bōrei（亡灵，一类幽灵）上做的文字游戏。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 133,
            "end": 138,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2950902,
          0.5507143,
          0.9107974,
          0.6492857
        ],
        "font_size": 19,
        "line_height": 1.4210526315789473,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
