      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0096-b008",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "To Pikachu, or not to Pikachu? Whether it’s for memorability, consistency, or simplicity’s sake, there is some merit in leaving a meaningful name unlocalized for international audiences",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1184445,
          0.6535714,
          0.2746687,
          0.7964286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1184445,
          0.6535714,
          0.2746687,
          0.7964286
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "要不要像 Pikachu 那样保留原名？无论是为了好记、一致还是简洁，面向国际受众时，不将一个有含义的名字本地化，也自有它的好处。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.111297,
          0.6535714,
          0.2705844,
          0.8042857
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "line_height": 1.4838709677419355,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "right"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.111297,
          0.6535714,
          0.2705844,
          0.8042857
        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "leading": 23.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0096-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Initially, Toby wasn’t sure that “Winnybohre” suited the character. He understood the reasoning behind the choice and wasn’t against the idea of renaming Napstablook, so he waited to see if the name grew on him. It still felt off months later, so he reverted the name back to “Napstablook” before the Japanese release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.292027,
          0.81,
          0.9138606,
          0.9021429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.292027,
          0.81,
          0.9138606,
          0.9021429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "最初，Toby 不确定 Winnybohre 是否适合这个角色。他理解这样命名的理由，也不反对给 Napstablook 改名，于是决定等等，看自己会不会慢慢喜欢上这个名字。几个月后，他仍觉得不太对劲，便在日版发行前把名字改回了 Napstablook。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
